"227406074", "author": {"steamid": "76561198331789084", "personaname": "Ryan", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Ryanlaoshi/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 187, "playtime_forever": 3425, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1965, "deck_playtime_at_review": 216, "last_played": 1782018147, "avatar": "e1c7192a4f307d0a3416618a23026859fbd268e7"}, "language": "english", "review": "Fun game, but have constant connection issues here in Asia when playing online.  I hope they add Asian servers in the sequel, specifically China.", "timestamp_created": 1780838969, "timestamp_updated": 1780838969, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.476190477609634399", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "227380081", "author": {"steamid": "76561199645410373", "personaname": "DoomKnight13", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199645410373/", "num_games_owned": 101, "num_reviews": 18, "playtime_forever": 890, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 718, "last_played": 1781152125, "avatar": "9fad9d9c17b08bc3e6b3fd47e19924f568e6fba5"}, "language": "english", "review": "incredible game with friend but sucks with bots.", "timestamp_created": 1780812021, "timestamp_updated": 1780812021, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 4, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.536884486675262451", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "227364874", "author": {"steamid": "76561198056780803", "personaname": "starship", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198056780803/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 23, "playtime_forever": 864, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 487, "last_played": 1780927342, "avatar": "6ae303fb1cf947d9745f76f57e3378054fbe5c57"}, "language": "english", "review": "It's not a terrible game, but it's not balanced. The ends of the first and second campaign as a solo player were really hard to complete. The third campaign wasn't. (Playing as a demolisher for all three.) And the whole thing feels kind of clumsy. Still really love the environment and the general Aliens franchise shtick. The music is pretty good. The perks and loadout system are intriguing.\r\n\r\nIt desperately needs proc gen levels. (Haven't finished the campaign so I'm not sure what happens after that, but playing the same levels repeatedly is boring.) I'm sure that would be hard to do with a lot of these level types, but I'd like something like random infested colonies with random layouts and random barricades, much like in the second Aliens movie.\r\n\r\nAll in all it's not a bad purchase for the price when it's on sale. I just wish there was a better, more modern aliens shooter. I don't regret buying it. I'd actually give it a neutral rating if Steam wasn't so dead-set on forcing binary choices on us.", "timestamp_created": 1780793256, "timestamp_updated": 1780793256, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 11, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.545633852481842041", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}]}